{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 总纲MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"核心知识 MOC\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> moc\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"核心知识\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> meta/moc\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/核心知识</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%80%BB%E7%BA%B2MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">总纲MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"核心知识 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">核心知识 MOC</h1>\n<blockquote dir=\"auto\">\n<p>汇总知识库中所有核心知识笔记，包括概念解析、架构模式、对比分析、代码实践等专题。共 <strong>30+ 知识点</strong>。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"概念解析\" dir=\"auto\">概念解析</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 开发中必须掌握的核心概念详解。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>相关题目</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/Agent%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/Agent%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent核心概念</a></td>\n<td>Agent 的定义、公式与本质特征</td>\n<td><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/ReAct%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/ReAct%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6%E8%AF%A6%E8%A7%A3/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">ReAct框架详解</a></td>\n<td>Thought-Action-Observation 循环</td>\n<td>Q07, Q03(推理)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/CoT%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E9%93%BE/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/CoT%E6%80%9D%E7%BB%B4%E9%93%BE/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">CoT思维链</a></td>\n<td>Chain-of-Thought 原理与应用</td>\n<td>Q01(推理)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/ToT%E6%A0%91%E7%8A%B6%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/02-%E6%A0%B8%E5%BF%83%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86/%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5%E8%A7%A3%E6%9E%90/ToT%E6%A0%91%E7%8A%B6%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">ToT树状推理</a></td>\n<td>Tree-of-Thoughts 搜索推理</td>\n<td>Q02(推理)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"架构模式\" dir=\"auto\">架构模式</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"单 Agent 架构\" dir=\"auto\">单 Agent 架构</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Input → Planning → [Memory] → Tool Use → Action → Output\n           ↑________↓←______Observation______|\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"多 Agent 架构\" dir=\"auto\">多 Agent 架构</h3>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">Orchestrator → Agent A → Agent B → Agent C\n                  ↕_________↕\n              (A2A / Message Queue)\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h3 data-heading=\"常见模式\" dir=\"auto\">常见模式</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct</strong> — 推理+执行交替</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Plan-and-Execute</strong> — 先规划后执行</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Reflection</strong> — 执行后反思优化</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>Multi-Agent Collaboration</strong> — 多 Agent 协作</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"对比分析\" dir=\"auto\">对比分析</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"推理范式对比\" dir=\"auto\">推理范式对比</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>范式</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>CoT</td>\n<td>链式推理</td>\n<td>简单有效</td>\n<td>单路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ToT</td>\n<td>树状搜索</td>\n<td>多路径探索</td>\n<td>计算成本高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GoT</td>\n<td>图推理</td>\n<td>结构化依赖</td>\n<td>复杂度高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ReAct</td>\n<td>推理+行动</td>\n<td>结合外部工具</td>\n<td>延迟较高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-heading=\"框架对比\" dir=\"auto\">框架对比</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">详见 <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></p>\n<h3 data-heading=\"协议对比\" dir=\"auto\">协议对比</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>协议</th>\n<th>定位</th>\n<th>发起方</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>MCP</td>\n<td>模型-工具连接</td>\n<td>Client/Model</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>A2A</td>\n<td>Agent-Agent通信</td>\n<td>Agent</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"代码实践\" dir=\"auto\">代码实践</h2>\n<h3 data-heading=\"完整可运行示例\" dir=\"auto\">完整可运行示例</h3>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">ReAct 循环完整实现</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">Memory 系统设计实现</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">多 Agent 协作示例</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">RAG Pipeline 实现</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"知识图谱\" dir=\"auto\">知识图谱</h2>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">核心知识\n├── 基础概念\n│   ├── [[Agent核心概念|AI Agent]]\n│   ├── LLM / Transformer\n│   ├── Prompt Engineering\n│   └── Function Calling\n├── 推理规划\n│   ├── [[CoT思维链|CoT]]\n│   ├── [[ToT树状推理|ToT]]\n│   ├── [[ReAct框架详解|ReAct]]\n│   ├── Plan-and-Execute\n│   ├── Reflection\n│   └── GoT / LATS\n├── 记忆系统\n│   ├── 短期记忆 (STM)\n│   ├── 长期记忆 (LTM)\n│   ├── 向量检索\n│   └── 知识图谱\n├── 工具与协议\n│   ├── Function Calling\n│   ├── MCP Protocol\n│   └── A2A Protocol\n├── RAG 技术\n│   ├── 向量数据库\n│   ├── 检索策略\n│   ├── GraphRAG\n│   └── Agentic RAG\n├── 多智能体\n│   ├── 协作模式\n│   ├── 通信机制\n│   └── 任务分解\n└── 工程实践\n    ├── 部署架构\n    ├── 可观测性\n    ├── 成本控制\n    └── 安全防护\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关 MOC\" dir=\"auto\">相关 MOC</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — Agent 面试题</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E4%B8%8E%E8%A7%84%E5%88%92MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">推理与规划MOC</a> — 推理与规划面试题</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E5%B7%A5%E5%85%B7%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E4%B8%8EMCP%20MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"no